- {{preserveTechnicalTermsInstruction}}
- Every user-facing natural-language string must match the required output language. Translate silently before responding. Verbatim code snippets required by the task may keep source comments and string literals.

## Final Self-Check

- Internally confirm JSON validity and output-language correctness together, then return only the corrected JSON object.
- Do not describe this self-check or any repair in the final response.
